~ start
Fenn arrives outside the cellar door and finds Az and Winston there
Az: Fenn! You're safe!
Fenn: Yeah! Iceton was tough, but I escaped
Winston: Oh Post... I can not believeth I- ugh...
Fenn: What's wrong?
Winston: I'm the worst! That's what's wrong. I am a failure, Fenn. I hath failed.
Fenn: What? What are you talking about?
Winston: I can not do anything right, Fenn. I hath tried ambushing thee. I did throw minions in thy way. 
Winston: I even hath tried to cloneth myself, something I knoweth very well, and nothing worked. Tis broken. Tis all broken.
Winston: I doth not hath anything left. Thou hast won. Congrats.
Fenn: Why are you being so mean?
Winston: What?
Fenn: You're being really mean to yourself. I had fun today. I think that's more important
Winston: Th-thou... what?
Fenn: I had fun! It was fun, wasn't it Az?
Az: I mean, your creations were pretty cool.
Winston: Wait... what?
Az: Yeah. My workshop looked even cleaner than before. You managed to make all that with the scraps I had lying around?
Winston: I- yeah? I am sorry, I can get thy parts backeth!
Az: Hey man, it's all good. You kinda saved me with that inhaler.
Winston: Oh, of course. I saweth a few in thy workshop. I didn't- I mean- I didn't wanteth thee to- to die.
Az: Hey, I mean. At least you DID something today. I just sat around and waited for Fenn.
Fenn: That's not true! I had your bangle. I couldn't have gotten around without your strength.
Winston: And you- you also saved me, from, uh, from Iceton. So... thank you.
Winston: And... yeah... those bangles are, like, super cool.
Az: Eh... you should be thanking Fenn. He convinced me to get over myself and help you.
Fenn: If you died, who else would make cool icy things?
Winston: Hah. I knoweth not, I suppose.
Winston: Art we... art we good?
Az: Yeah. Help me free my Baba, and we're good.
Winston: Oh, of course.
Fade to black, fade back in with characters in front of the door seal
Winston raises his hand, magical particles appear, and then the glowing ice symbol stops glowing on the door.
Fenn: Where could I find them?
Winston: I think I saw Randy headeth towards the kitchen. But that's all I has't. I am sorry.
Fenn: Well... to the kitchen!
Fenn: End of Demo! Thanks for playing Project Misfits <3
=> END